    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Adora.exe Has Stopped Working</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Adora takes a hit in battle and spends the day a little... off.  Confused, clumsy, and temporarily useless, she still somehow fumbles her way through the mission.  Catra roasts her, Glimmer loses it, and Bow just tries to help.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
